    "tags": [],
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>(10th Level)</em></p><p>You cast across groups through shared symbolism.</p><p>Choose a collective identity:</p><ul><li><p>Crowd</p></li><li><p>Mob</p></li><li><p>Choir</p></li><li><p>Army</p></li><li><p>Congregation</p></li><li><p>Survivors</p></li></ul><p>You may affect the group as a unified symbolic system:</p><ul><li><p>Shared illusion</p></li><li><p>Shared fear</p></li><li><p>Shared calm</p></li><li><p>Shared belief</p></li></ul><p>It feels like fate—not domination.</p><h3>Surge Interaction</h3><p>Group alignment can bank additional Surge.</p><h3>Risk</h3><p>If the shared metaphor fractures, misfire risk spikes.</p>",
      "chat": ""
    },
